Z||000000||Rare87GT||11-15-2001||04:38 AM||||Well I was over at a friend's apartment complex hanging out when after a friend left notified us that some people with flashlights were around my car.  So about 10 of us quickly darted outside to see what was going on and I hoped that my stuff was still there. BTW, my friends just finished making a custom passenger floor box for a 12" sub (need to get pics up), and I had an amp testing it that was on the ground, and an amp in the trunk.  I also have a Kenwood Z919 mp3 player that would have been stolen as well.  Well as for the chinese people that were trying to break in, we got them all and the cops came, and they even pulled the car over that had the stereo systems in the trunk and so on.  Anyways, I will be swapping my old alarm in tomorrow evening and hopefully getting my windows tinted in a few weeks.  Im just glad nothing happened to my car or my stuff.  Later.<P>------------------<BR>1987 GT *5 Speed*<BR>(Canadian Car)<BR>2.8L Mods--No Cat, K&N||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cheever3000||11-15-2001||01:43 PM||||Let's see if I got that right...<BR>You were warned that people might be breaking into your car, you & your friends ran out & found them trying or preparing to do that, you surrounded them and they stayed there without a fight until the cops came.  I'm guessing if they had not yet broken into your car there wouldn't be enough proof to get them on anything, but you say there was stuff in their trunk - was that stolen stuff?  So the perps were apprehended?  If so, YAY!!!  Thank you & your friends for getting that scum off the streets & away from the rest of us!<BR>||||reg||4
