Z||000003||Rare87GT||11-15-2001||08:16 PM||||They were using flashlights taking a look at my car and that's how we knew they were probably going to break into my car.   We all ran after them, and I drove my car and saw them down a little ways past the apartments. The cops got the car with the 2 other suspects and the 2 kids running from us.  So all 4 were arrested.  There ended up being like 10 cops there.  At least nothing happened to my car or I would have had to lay the smack down on the Asians.<P>------------------<BR>1987 GT *5 Speed*<BR>(Canadian Car)<BR>2.8L Mods--No Cat, K&N||||reg||1
